AltoRewardsDistributor::acceptPendingRoot
├── when pending root is not set
│   └── it should revert
├── when merkle root to accept is nonzero and does not match pending root
│   └── it should revert
├── when caller is not owner and timelock has not expired
│   └── it should revert
└── when conditions are met
    ├── when caller is owner (can bypass timelock)
    │   ├── it should set merkle root to pending root
    │   ├── it should delete pending root
    │   └── it should emit AcceptPendingMerkleRoot event
    └── when caller is not owner but timelock has expired
        ├── it should set merkle root to pending root
        ├── it should delete pending root
        └── it should emit AcceptPendingMerkleRoot event
